<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ s/adj March qtr retail sales fell 1.0 pct.</title>
<headline>NZ s/adj March qtr retail sales fell 1.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand (SNZ) on Friday released the following retail sales data for March and the March 1997 quarter.</p>
<p>Revised figures are in brackets.</p>
<p>Seasonally adjusted quarter-on-quarter at March 1995 prices</p>
<p>    March qtr 1997	  Dec qtr 1996	  March qtr 1996</p>
<p>    -1.0 pct		 -0.3 pct (-0.1)	+3.6 pct</p>
<p>Actual sales change from same qtr previous year:</p>
<p>    March qtr 1997	  Dec qtr 1996	  March qtr 1996</p>
<p>    -2.0 pct		 +2.5 pct		+5.4 pct</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted, month-on-month:  </p>
<p>    March 1997		Feb 1997	     March 1996</p>
<p>    -3.9 pct		 -2.4 pct		-3.2 pct</p>
<p>Total actual retail sales (percentage change from same month previous year):</p>
<p>    March 1997		Feb 1997	     March 1996</p>
<p>    -4.8 pct		 -3.5 pct		+2.7 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
